flowchart TD
    Start["Agent Task Boot / Navigation Query"] --> Route{"Operation Type"}

    %% Progressive Disclosure
    Route -->|"Read Context / Docs"| TierCheck{"Granularity Required?"}
    TierCheck -->|"Overview / Map"| Tier1["Tier 1: disclose.py --level index<br/>(Reads INDEX.md / TOC &lt; 200 tokens)"]
    TierCheck -->|"Validate Topic"| Tier2["Tier 2: disclose.py --level summary<br/>(Extracts frontmatter &amp; abstract &lt; 100 tokens)"]
    TierCheck -->|"Implement / Audit"| Tier3["Tier 3: disclose.py --level deep<br/>(Loads complete specification &amp; code)"]

    %% Associative Graph
    Route -->|"Explore Connections"| Graph["query_graph.py --concept &lt;name&gt;<br/>(Maps inbound backlinks &amp; outbound links in sub-10ms)"]

    %% Asymmetric Persistence
    Route -->|"Encounter Failure / Friction"| FailGuard["Asymmetric Persistence Guard"]
    FailGuard --> Rec["record_insight.py --topic &lt;name&gt; --type friction<br/>(Appends insight to context/memory.md &amp; wiki/concepts/)"]
    Rec --> Rollback["Safe Git Rollback (git checkout / git branch -D)<br/>*Code discarded, but learned memory preserved!*"]

    %% Confidence Decay
    Route -->|"Protocol 128 Audit"| Decay["audit_decay.py --check<br/>(Finds CONFIRMED entries &gt; 30 days old)"]
    Decay -->|"Decay Triggered"| Downgrade["audit_decay.py --apply<br/>(Downgrades status to OBSERVED)"]
